00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:45.000
then we create the disconnect between our ability to use an effective identification model based on instructional discrepancy to find kids. What that does is it pushes those of us who know better and can do better and have the resources to go outside of the school, and we get psychologists, diagnosticians, and others to do independent testing. We come back into the schools and we say, look, my kid can't read. They're struggling. They're way behind.

