00:15:45.000 --> 00:16:22.000
They've been showing up to school. What are we going to do with it? This looks like they have a disability of some type. So you can see that there's really some challenges that we present kind of across the board. And what I want to highlight is, elevating instruction for all across all schools is going to create the context we need to identify those of us who are set up to struggle and need more instruction intervention to begin with. We're going to take a short break. When we return, I'll talk to Dr. Odegaard about early signs of dyslexia and whether warning signs can be identified even before children begin to learn to read.

